"at the top of your personal page AND at the top of the main contribution or "
"event registration page."
msgstr "Predstavite kampanjo in pojasnite, zakaj jo podpirate. To besedilo bo prikazano na vrhu vaše osebne strani IN na vrhu glavne strani za prispevke ali prijavo na dogodek."

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Form/Campaign.tpl
msgid "The text for the contribute or register button."
msgstr "Besedilo gumba za prispevek ali prijavo."

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Form/Campaign.tpl
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, an \"honor roll\" will be displayed with the "
"names (or nicknames) of the people who supported you. (Donors will have the "
"option to remain anonymous. Their names will NOT be listed.)"
msgstr "Če je ta možnost označena, bo prikazan seznam podpornikov z imeni oziroma vzdevki oseb, ki so vas podprle. (Plačniki bodo lahko ostali anonimni. Njihova imena NE bodo prikazana.)"

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Form/Campaign.tpl
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, you will receive an email notification when "
"people contribute to your campaign."
msgstr "Če je ta možnost označena, boste prejeli e-poštno obvestilo, ko bodo ljudje prispevali k vaši kampanji."

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Form/Contribute.hlp
msgid ""
"When Personal Campaign Pages are enabled, constituents will see a link "
"inviting them to create their own fundraising page after making a "
"contribution.  Contributions from people who come in through a Personal "
"Campaign Page are recorded as \"soft credits\" for the supporter who created"
" that campaign page."
msgstr "Ko so osebne strani kampanj omogočene, bodo uporabniki po oddaji prispevka videli povezavo s povabilom, naj ustvarijo svojo stran za zbiranje sredstev. Prispevki oseb, ki pridejo prek osebne strani kampanje, se zabeležijo kot posredni prispevki podporniku, ki je ustvaril to stran kampanje."

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Form/Contribute.hlp templates/CRM/PCP/Form/Event.hlp
msgid ""
"The Supporter Profile is used to collect or update basic information (e.g. "
"name and email address) from users while they are creating a Personal "
"Campaign Page. The profile you select must be configured with 'Account "
"creation required' (under Profile Settings &raquo; Advanced Settings). You "
"must include an Email address field - and you may include any number of "
"other fields in the profile. If you don't yet have an appropriate Profile "
"configured, you will need to <a href='%1'>create one first</a>, and then "
"return to this form to select it."
msgstr "Profil podpornika se uporablja za zbiranje ali posodabljanje osnovnih podatkov uporabnikov (na primer imena in e-poštnega naslova) med ustvarjanjem osebne strani kampanje. Izbrani profil mora imeti omogočeno možnost »Zahtevano ustvarjanje računa« (pod Nastavitve profila &raquo; Napredne nastavitve). Vsebovati mora polje za e-poštni naslov, dodate pa lahko poljubno število drugih polj. Če ustreznega profila še niste nastavili, ga morate najprej <a href='%1'>ustvariti</a>, nato pa se vrniti v ta obrazec in ga izbrati."

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Form/Contribute.tpl templates/CRM/PCP/Form/Event.tpl
msgid ""
"No Profile with a user account registration option has been configured / "
"enabled for your site. You need to <a href='%1'>configure a Supporter "
"profile</a> first. It will be used to collect or update basic information "
"from users while they are creating a Personal Campaign Page."
msgstr "Na spletnem mestu ni nastavljenega oziroma omogočenega profila z možnostjo registracije uporabniškega računa. Najprej morate <a href='%1'>nastaviti profil podpornika</a>. Uporabljal se bo za zbiranje ali posodabljanje osnovnih podatkov uporabnikov med ustvarjanjem osebne strani kampanje."

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Form/Event.hlp
msgid ""
"Personal Campaign Pages provide your constituents with the ability to "
"promote this event or a related fundraising effort. When Personal Campaign "
"Pages are enabled constituents will see a link after registering for this "
"event which invites them to create their own page to promote the event (or "
"promote a related online contribution page). Event registration fees (or "
"contributions) from people who come in through a Personal Campaign Page are "
"recorded as \"soft credits\" for the supporter who created that campaign "
"page."
msgstr "Osebne strani kampanj uporabnikom omogočajo promocijo tega dogodka ali povezanega zbiranja sredstev. Ko so osebne strani kampanj omogočene, bodo uporabniki po prijavi na dogodek videli povezavo s povabilom, naj ustvarijo svojo stran za promocijo dogodka oziroma povezane spletne strani za prispevke. Prijavnine za dogodek oziroma prispevki oseb, ki pridejo prek osebne strani kampanje, se zabeležijo kot posredni prispevki podporniku, ki je ustvaril to stran kampanje."

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Form/Event.hlp
msgid ""
"Notification will be sent to this email address whenever a Personal Campaign"
" Page linked to this event is either created or updated. The notification "
"will include links to view the campaign page as well as the contact record "
"of the creator of the page."
msgstr "Obvestilo bo poslano na ta e-poštni naslov vsakič, ko bo ustvarjena ali posodobljena osebna stran kampanje, povezana s tem dogodkom. Vsebovalo bo povezavi za ogled strani kampanje in zapisa stika njenega ustvarjalca."

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Form/Event.hlp
msgid ""
"Can the 'owner' of a Personal Campaign Page use the Tell-a-Friend function "
"to send emails to people inviting them to visit their page and register or "
"contribute? NOTE: Tell a Friend emails will automatically include a link to "
"the sender's campaign page."
msgstr "Ali lahko »lastnik« osebne strani kampanje uporabi možnost Povej prijatelju za pošiljanje e-poštnih povabil k obisku strani ter prijavi ali prispevku? OPOMBA: E-poštna sporočila Povej prijatelju bodo samodejno vsebovala povezavo do strani kampanje pošiljatelja."

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Form/Event.hlp
msgid ""
"Text for the link inviting constituents to create a Personal Campaign Page. "
"This link will appear on the Event registration Thank-you page as well as on"
" each Personal Campaign Page. Leave blank if you do not want constituents to"
" be prompted to create their own Personal Campaign Pages."
msgstr "Besedilo povezave, ki uporabnike vabi k ustvarjanju osebne strani kampanje. Povezava bo prikazana na strani z zahvalo za prijavo na dogodek in na vsaki osebni strani kampanje. Če uporabnikov ne želite pozvati k ustvarjanju njihovih strani, pustite polje prazno."

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Form/Event.hlp
msgid ""
"Select \"Event\" if you want your supporters to encourage people in their "
"network to also register for this event. Select \"Contribution\" if you want"
" supporters to promote a related online fundraising campaign (by linking to "
"an online contribution page)."
msgstr "Izberite »Dogodek«, če želite, da podporniki spodbujajo ljudi iz svoje mreže k prijavi na ta dogodek. Izberite »Prispevek«, če želite, da podporniki promovirajo povezano spletno kampanjo za zbiranje sredstev s povezavo do spletne strani za prispevke."

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Form/Event.hlp
msgid ""
"Select the related online contribution page that supporters of this event "
"are promoting. Visitors to their Personal Campaign pages will be directed to"
" the selected online contribution page to donate money."
msgstr "Izberite povezano spletno stran za prispevke, ki jo promovirajo podporniki tega dogodka. Obiskovalci njihovih osebnih strani kampanj bodo za oddajo prispevka preusmerjeni na izbrano spletno stran za prispevke."

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Form/Event.tpl
msgid ""
"Allow constituents to create their own personal fundraising pages linked to "
"this event."
msgstr "Dovoli uporabnikom ustvarjanje lastnih strani za zbiranje sredstev, povezanih s tem dogodkom."

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Form/PCP.tpl templates/CRM/PCP/Page/PCP.hlp
msgid ""
"You can also place additional links (or menu items) allowing constituents to"
" create their own fundraising pages using the following URL:"
msgstr "Dodate lahko tudi dodatne povezave ali menijske elemente, prek katerih bodo uporabniki z naslednjim URL-jem lahko ustvarili svoje strani za zbiranje sredstev:"

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Form/PCP.tpl templates/CRM/PCP/Page/PCP.hlp
msgid ""
"You can also create front-end links (or menu items) allowing constituents to"
" create their own fundraising pages using the Menu Manager. Select "
"<strong>Contributions &raquo; Personal Campaign Pages</strong> and then "
"select this event."
msgstr "Z upravljalnikom menijev lahko ustvarite tudi javne povezave oziroma menijske elemente, prek katerih bodo uporabniki ustvarili svoje strani za zbiranje sredstev. Izberite <strong>Prispevki &raquo; Osebne strani kampanj</strong> in nato ta dogodek."

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Form/PCPAccount.tpl
msgid ""
"Creating your own campaign page is simple. Fill in some basic information "
"below, which will allow you to manage your page and invite friends to "
"support you. Then click 'Continue' to personalize and announce your page."
msgstr "Ustvarjanje lastne strani kampanje je preprosto. Spodaj vnesite nekaj osnovnih podatkov, s katerimi boste lahko upravljali stran in povabili prijatelje, naj vas podprejo. Nato kliknite »Nadaljuj«, da stran prilagodite in objavite."

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Page/PCP.hlp
msgid ""
"Personal Campaign Pages (PCPs) allow your constituents to create their own "
"fundraising page for your organization. This means that a donor, after "
"donating to your organization, can elect to create a page with her own "
"photo, text, and personal information. She can then send a link to the page "
"to her friends, soliciting support for your organization. This is a powerful"
" way to widely and quickly spread the message about your campaign."
msgstr "Osebne strani kampanj (PCP) uporabnikom omogočajo, da ustvarijo lastno stran za zbiranje sredstev za vašo organizacijo. Po oddaji prispevka lahko plačnik ustvari stran s svojo fotografijo, besedilom in osebnimi podatki. Povezavo do strani lahko nato pošlje prijateljem in jih povabi k podpori vaši organizaciji. Tako se lahko sporočilo vaše kampanje hitro razširi med veliko ljudi."

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Page/PCP.hlp
msgid ""
"When someone donates through a personal campaign page, a soft credit is "
"given to the owner of the page to recognize the role she played in the "
"contribution. CiviContribute has a section that allows you to administer all"
" of the PCPs for your organization. You can require approval before a PCP "
"goes 'live', and disable or delete any campaign pages you don't approve of."
msgstr "Ko nekdo prispeva prek osebne strani kampanje, se lastniku strani dodeli posredni prispevek kot priznanje njegove vloge pri prispevku. CiviContribute vsebuje razdelek za upravljanje vseh osebnih strani kampanj vaše organizacije. Pred objavo strani PCP lahko zahtevate odobritev ter onemogočite ali izbrišete strani kampanj, ki jih ne odobrite."

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Page/PCP.tpl
msgid ""
"This screen shows all the Personal Campaign Pages created in the system and "
"allows administrator to review them and change their status."
msgstr "Na tem zaslonu so prikazane vse osebne strani kampanj, ustvarjene v sistemu, skrbnik pa jih lahko pregleda in spremeni njihovo stanje."

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Page/PCP.tpl
msgid "Contribution Page / Event"
msgstr "Stran za prispevke/dogodek"

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Page/PCP.tpl
msgid "View Personal Campaign Page"
msgstr "Ogled osebne strani kampanje"

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Page/PCP.tpl
msgid "View page"
msgstr "Ogled strani"

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Page/PCP.tpl
msgid "There are no Personal Campaign Pages which match your search criteria."
msgstr "Nobena osebna stran kampanje ne ustreza vašim iskalnim merilom."

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Page/PCP.tpl
msgid "There are currently no Personal Campaign Pages."
msgstr "Trenutno ni osebnih strani kampanj."

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Page/PCPInfo.tpl
msgid "This is a Personal Campaign Page in support of <a %1>%2</a>."
msgstr "To je osebna stran kampanje v podporo <a %1>%2</a>."

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Page/PCPInfo.tpl
msgid "The current status of your page is: %1."
msgstr "Trenutno stanje vaše strani je: %1."

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Page/PCPInfo.tpl
msgid ""
"You will receive an email notification when your page is Approved and you "
"can begin promoting your campaign."
msgstr "Ko bo vaša stran odobrena in boste lahko začeli promovirati kampanjo, boste prejeli e-poštno obvestilo."

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Page/PCPInfo.tpl
msgid "People can register for this event starting on %1 until %2."
msgstr "Prijava na ta dogodek je mogoča od %1 do %2."

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Page/PCPInfo.tpl
msgid "People can register for this event starting on %1."
msgstr "Prijava na ta dogodek je mogoča od %1."

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Page/PCPInfo.tpl
msgid "This campaign is active from %1 until %2."
msgstr "Ta kampanja je aktivna od %1 do %2."

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Page/PCPInfo.tpl
msgid "This campaign is active from %1."
msgstr "Ta kampanja je aktivna od %1."

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Page/PCPInfo.tpl
msgid "You can:"
msgstr "Lahko:"

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Page/PCPInfo.tpl
msgid ""
"You must be logged in to your account to access the editing options above. "
"(If you visit this page without logging in, you will be viewing the page in "
"\"live\" mode - as your visitors and friends see it.)"
msgstr "Za dostop do zgornjih možnosti urejanja morate biti prijavljeni v svoj račun. (Če stran obiščete brez prijave, jo boste videli v načinu »v živo«, kot jo vidijo obiskovalci in prijatelji.)"

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Page/PCPInfo.tpl
msgid "Goal"
msgstr "Cilj"

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Page/PCPInfo.tpl
msgid "towards our goal"
msgstr "do našega cilja"

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Page/PCPInfo.tpl
msgid "raised"
msgstr "zbrano"

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Page/PCPInfo.tpl
msgid "HONOR ROLL"
msgstr "SEZNAM PODPORNIKOV"

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Page/PCPInfo.tpl
msgid "Stop scrolling"
msgstr "Ustavi pomikanje"

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Page/PCPInfo.tpl
msgid "Stop"
msgstr "Ustavi"

#: templates/CRM/PCP/Page/PCPInfo.tpl
msgid "Start scrolling"
msgstr "Začni pomikanje"

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_notify_html.tpl
#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_notify_subject.tpl
msgid "Personal Campaign Page Notification"
msgstr "Obvestilo o osebni strani kampanje"

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_notify_html.tpl
msgid "Updated personal campaign page"
msgstr "Posodobljena osebna stran kampanje"

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_notify_html.tpl
msgid "New personal campaign page"
msgstr "Nova osebna stran kampanje"

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_notify_html.tpl
msgid "View Page"
msgstr "Ogled strani"

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_notify_html.tpl
msgid "Linked to Contribution Page"
msgstr "Povezano s stranjo za prispevke"

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_notify_html.tpl
msgid "Manage Personal Campaign Pages"
msgstr "Upravljaj osebne strani kampanj"

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_owner_notify_html.tpl
msgid "You have received a donation at your personal page"
msgstr "Prek svoje osebne strani ste prejeli prispevek"

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_owner_notify_html.tpl
msgid "Your fundraising total has been updated."
msgstr "Skupni znesek zbranih sredstev je bil posodobljen."

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_owner_notify_html.tpl
msgid ""
"The donor's information is listed below.  You can choose to contact them and"
" convey your thanks if you wish."
msgstr "Podatki plačnika so navedeni spodaj. Če želite, se lahko obrnete nanj in se mu zahvalite."

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_owner_notify_html.tpl
msgid ""
"The donor's name has been added to your honor roll unless they asked not to "
"be included."
msgstr "Ime plačnika je bilo dodano na vaš seznam podpornikov, razen če je prosil, naj se ga ne vključi."

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_owner_notify_subject.tpl
msgid "Someone has just donated to your personal campaign page"
msgstr "Nekdo je pravkar prispeval prek vaše osebne strani kampanje"

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_status_change_html.tpl
msgid "Your Personal Campaign Page"
msgstr "Vaša osebna stran kampanje"

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_status_change_html.tpl
msgid "Your personal campaign page has been approved and is now live."
msgstr "Vaša osebna stran kampanje je bila odobrena in je zdaj objavljena."

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_status_change_html.tpl
#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_supporter_notify_html.tpl
msgid "Whenever you want to preview, update or promote your page"
msgstr "Kadar želite prikazati predogled, posodobiti ali promovirati svojo stran"

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_status_change_html.tpl
#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_supporter_notify_html.tpl
msgid "Login to your account"
msgstr "Prijavite se v svoj račun"

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_status_change_html.tpl
#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_supporter_notify_html.tpl
msgid "Go to your page"
msgstr "Pojdite na svojo stran"

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_status_change_html.tpl
#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_supporter_notify_html.tpl
msgid ""
"When you view your campaign page WHILE LOGGED IN, the page includes links to"
" edit your page, tell friends, and update your contact info."
msgstr "Ko si stran kampanje ogledate MED PRIJAVO, vsebuje povezave za urejanje strani, obveščanje prijateljev in posodobitev vaših kontaktnih podatkov."

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_status_change_html.tpl
msgid ""
"After logging in, you can use this form to promote your fundraising page"
msgstr "Po prijavi lahko s tem obrazcem promovirate svojo stran za zbiranje sredstev"

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_status_change_html.tpl
#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_supporter_notify_html.tpl
msgid "Questions? Send email to"
msgstr "Imate vprašanja? Pišite na"

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_status_change_html.tpl
msgid ""
"Your personal campaign page has been reviewed. There were some issues with "
"the content which prevented us from approving the page. We are sorry for any"
" inconvenience."
msgstr "Vaša osebna stran kampanje je bila pregledana. Zaradi nekaterih težav z vsebino je nismo mogli odobriti. Opravičujemo se za nevšečnosti."

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_status_change_html.tpl
msgid "Please contact our site administrator for more information"
msgstr "Za več informacij se obrnite na skrbnika našega spletnega mesta"

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_status_change_subject.tpl
#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_supporter_notify_subject.tpl
msgid "Your Personal Campaign Page for %1"
msgstr "Vaša osebna stran kampanje za %1"

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_supporter_notify_html.tpl
msgid "Thanks for creating a personal campaign page in support of %1."
msgstr "Hvala, ker ste ustvarili osebno stran kampanje v podporo %1."

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_supporter_notify_html.tpl
msgid "Promoting Your Page"
msgstr "Promocija vaše strani"

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_supporter_notify_html.tpl
msgid "You can begin your fundraising efforts using our \"Tell a Friend\" form"
msgstr "Zbiranje sredstev lahko začnete z našim obrazcem »Povej prijatelju«"

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_supporter_notify_html.tpl
msgid "Click this link and follow the prompts"
msgstr "Kliknite to povezavo in sledite navodilom"

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_supporter_notify_html.tpl
msgid ""
"Send email to family, friends and colleagues with a personal message about "
"this campaign."
msgstr "Družini, prijateljem in sodelavcem pošljite e-poštno sporočilo z osebnim sporočilom o tej kampanji."

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_supporter_notify_html.tpl
msgid "Include this link to your fundraising page in your emails"
msgstr "V e-poštna sporočila vključite to povezavo do svoje strani za zbiranje sredstev"

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_supporter_notify_html.tpl
msgid "Managing Your Page"
msgstr "Upravljanje vaše strani"

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_supporter_notify_html.tpl
msgid ""
"Your page requires administrator review before you can begin your "
"fundraising efforts."
msgstr "Pred začetkom zbiranja sredstev mora vašo stran pregledati skrbnik."

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_supporter_notify_html.tpl
msgid ""
"A notification email has been sent to the site administrator, and you will "
"receive another notification from them as soon as the review process is "
"complete."
msgstr "Skrbniku spletnega mesta je bilo poslano e-poštno obvestilo. Takoj ko bo pregled končan, boste prejeli še eno obvestilo."

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_supporter_notify_html.tpl
msgid "You can still preview your page prior to approval"
msgstr "Pred odobritvijo si lahko še vedno ogledate predogled strani"

#: xml/templates/message_templates/pcp_supporter_notify_html.tpl
msgid "Click this link"
msgstr "Kliknite to povezavo"
